hermes-lang-tr

The Turkish strings in `locales/` are an independent community translation by
the pack's authors, prepared with AI assistance from the English catalogs of
NousResearch/hermes-agent (MIT License). The key names and the English source
text they translate belong to hermes-agent.

Hermes ships a bundled Turkish catalog for the CLI and messaging gateway
(`locales/tr.yaml`) and for the TUI (`locales/tr.tui.yaml`); the Desktop app
has no bundled Turkish catalog. This pack ships all three surfaces, so it both
fills the Desktop gap and overrides the bundled Turkish wording where the
community translation differs.
